  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Let me explain\nOn the camera l, there’s a “Record Animation” button or something of sorts that will record the cameras movement when you’re moving it around. Then when you hit stop, the camera can replay that same movement (wether smooth cam is on, the focus changes, angle of camera changes, etc.)\nThis feature would be PERFECT for content creators so they can get the perfect camera if motion they want if they are working alone. This has always been a problem for me. I would need a camera shot but most of my friends have a Quest making it significantly harder and also a huge downgrade on graphics. I’m sure other people have had this issue. This would help out so much!",
